# Frontend environment variables
#
# The frontend requires NO environment variables. The API and the SPA are served
# from the same origin (single-port serving), so the browser reaches the API via a
# relative `/api` path and Better Auth falls back to window.location.origin.
#
# Only re-add a variable here if you split the frontend and backend onto DIFFERENT
# origins. In that case add a VITE_-prefixed base URL and use it in
# pkg/api/src/client.ts. Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser —
# never put secrets here.
#
#   VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
